    <string name="gf_wuwa_preset_body">Every cvar in every section is tuned per preset in the generator — the chip sets shadow resolution, render percentage, SSR, streaming and view distance, grass cull and LOD bias together, the way the reference tool\'s presets do.</string>
    <string name="gf_game_log">GAME LOG</string>
    <string name="gf_decrypted">decrypted</string>
    <string name="gf_plaintext">plaintext</string>
    <string name="gf_wuwa_log_body">The game\'s own Client.log is the only source for the facts no device read can supply: thermal events, GPU out-of-memory counts, the FPS actually reached versus the cap, the cvars the game set for itself. It is XOR-obfuscated; this reads the bytes exactly (never through a shell cat), decrypts, and re-scores the recommendation above with what the last play session measured. The log is written only after a session — analyze after playing.</string>
