    <string name="gf_tuner_intro">SMART RECOMMEND guesses from device facts; this measures instead. Each round deploys the selected preset at the frame-rate target above, you play a session, then Measure reads what the game\'s own log recorded (average, minimum, stability). Under 85%% of target it steps one preset down the quality ladder and tries again — up to %1$d rounds, or fewer if the target is met.</string>
    <string name="gf_start_tune">START AUTO-TUNE</string>
    <string name="gf_tuner_need_channel">Needs a deploy channel — root/Shizuku or the SAF folder. SAF cannot stop the game before a deploy, so close the game yourself when the tuner uses it.</string>
